{"4744790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marine♡Slalom", "steam_appid": 4744790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[NOTICE]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was created as part of Byking Inc.'s new employee training program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not run properly or unexpected issues may occur.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A keyboard and mouse or controller is required to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marine Slalom is a high-speed action game that challenges you to narrowly dodge obstacles across the open sea and aim for the highest score.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE A SPLASH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase high scores with daring dodges and boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/3c55d9bf36d153d75f9868dad569c141.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/3c55d9bf36d153d75f9868dad569c141.webm?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/3c55d9bf36d153d75f9868dad569c141.mp4?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● RACK UP COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the tide to a high score with perfectly timed maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your timing and build combos with chained dodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher your combo, the more your score climbs—but watch out! One failed dodge and you'll lose precious points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/89c74bdd81ef33e9e5519617f239afe0.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/89c74bdd81ef33e9e5519617f239afe0.webm?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/89c74bdd81ef33e9e5519617f239afe0.mp4?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● HIT TOP SPEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your boost to speed ahead toward the next obstacle—then dodge at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach obstacles at top speed and rack up points before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/732d666380d58d4e1fb3b3eaffa8c617.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/732d666380d58d4e1fb3b3eaffa8c617.webm?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/732d666380d58d4e1fb3b3eaffa8c617.mp4?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/f1dfeba8bb8db95c43c0717714364bb5.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/f1dfeba8bb8db95c43c0717714364bb5.webm?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/f1dfeba8bb8db95c43c0717714364bb5.mp4?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● LANE STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right lane at the right time is the key to a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the course and discover the best route through the lanes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine smart lane changes with well-timed boosts to push your score even higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/0479c3c6d38aa74a1ffa626e8f89a710.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/0479c3c6d38aa74a1ffa626e8f89a710.webm?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/0479c3c6d38aa74a1ffa626e8f89a710.mp4?t=1787712392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● SCORED-BASED RANKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score determines your rank at the end of each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy three unique result poses, each with its own cute, playful and humorous style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/91676bafb7404a0309b2db3701ba4220.poster.avif?t=1787712392\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744790/extras/91676bafb7404a0309b2db3701ba4220.webm?t=178771239